  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Humanitarian Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s theory of change is that if the humanitarian coordination, information management, and assessments (HCIMA) and the humanitarian policy, studies, analysis, or application (HPSAA) sectors are supported by information management services, NGO coordination as well as NNGOs capacity building, then the collective of actors engaged in the response will better utilize the available resources for the benefit of the affected communities. The total number of beneficiaries that will be supported under this award is 30 non-government organizations (NNGOs).</narrative>
  </description>
